  "content": "<h1>SlashBlade Inspect</h1><p>一款為經典拔刀劍（SlashBlade）模組帶來帥氣武器視檢功能的 Minecraft 模組。</p><h2>目前提供的特性：</h2><ul>\n<li>按下 <strong>G</strong> 鍵即可觸發拔刀劍的帥氣視檢動畫。</li>\n<li>在遊戲中獲得流暢且沉浸的武器觀賞體驗。</li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>如果有想法或發現錯誤，請：</strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Moflop/SlashBladeInspect/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Issues · Moflop/SlashBlade-Inspect</a></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>或</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Moflop/SlashBladeInspect/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pull requests · Moflop/SlashBlade-Inspect</a></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>Github：</strong></span><br><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Moflop/SlashBladeInspect\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moflop/SlashBlade-Inspect：在 Minecraft 中按 G 鍵檢視你的拔刀劍！</a></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>授權條款：</strong></span> <strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Moflop/SlashBladeInspect/blob/master/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT 授權</a></span></strong></p><p>————————————————————————————————————</p><p>為經典的拔刀劍（SlashBlade）模組帶來帥氣的武器視檢功能！</p><h5>目前提供的特性：</h5><ul>\n<li>按下 <strong>G</strong> 鍵即可觸發拔刀劍的視檢（Inspect）動作，全方位欣賞你的愛刀。</li>\n<li>流暢且極具沉浸感的遊戲內武器觀賞體驗。</li>\n</ul><h5><strong>有想法或發現錯誤，請：</strong></h5><p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Moflop/SlashBladeInspect/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Issues · Moflop/SlashBlade-Inspect</a></span></strong></p><p><strong>或</strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Moflop/SlashBladeInspect/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pull requests · Moflop/SlashBlade-Inspect</a></strong></span></p><h5><strong>Github：</strong></h5><p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Moflop/SlashBladeInspect\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moflop/SlashBlade-Inspect：為經典的拔刀劍模組帶來帥氣的武器視檢功能！</a></span></strong></p><p><strong>授權條款：</strong> <strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Moflop/SlashBladeInspect/blob/master/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT 授權</a></span></strong></p><h2><strong>Support Us/支持我們：</strong></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.com%252fa%252fmewkooo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_ecd5707f-8a0d-4b69-b75b-ed3107aa150b.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p>",
